{
  "slug": "dropbox",
  "name": "Dropbox",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The Dropbox plugin for Claude connects your Dropbox files directly to Claude, so you can search, organize, save generated content, and create sharing links without switching tools. It respects your existing Dropbox permissions, and Claude only works with files you already have access to.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `clean-up-dropbox-content` (Clean up Dropbox content by identifying obsolete, duplicate, temporary, or unwanted files and deleting only after explicit review), `collect-files-with-request` (Create, inspect, and manage Dropbox file requests for collecting uploads from other people), `find-dropbox-content` (Find Dropbox files and folders relevant to a user request), `inspect-dropbox-file` (Inspect a Dropbox file or folder by checking metadata, shared links, and file content when needed), `organize-dropbox-folder` (Organize Dropbox files and folders by creating folders, copying content, or moving content into a cleaner structure), `share-dropbox-content` (Share Dropbox files or folders by creating shared links, inspecting existing shared links, or explaining current shared-link state)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `claude_app_mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dropbox@claude-plugins-official` from `dropbox/dropbox-ai-plugins` (`claude`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
